==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-for the time being.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} [[temporarily]]; [[for now]]; [[until]] [[later]]; until the situation changes; in an indefinite period of time.
#: {{ux|en|I think I will ignore the problem '''for the time being'''.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1941|month=October|author=F. S. Bond|title=The Railways of China|journal=Railway Magazine|page=440|text=And so, unfortunately, this great and spreading network of railways, that recently showed such promise as a major instrument in the modern development of China, must be left '''for the time being''' in the melting-pot of Armageddon.}}

